ifice→copy spell), Affinity (own + granted to other spells), Flying/Haste/Vigilance/Deathtouch keywords, opponent-upkeep loot trigger, land mana abilities (incl. restricted/pay-life) + animate-to-creature with cast trigger.\n   - Engine seams: `cost_reduction(game)->int` hook; `register_triggers`/`register_replacement_effects`; `get_targets`→`TargetRequirement(filter_fn, description, zone)`; `on_resolve` reading `self.chosen_targets`; `get_loyalty_abilities`→`LoyaltyAbility`; `get_mana_abilities`→`ManaAbility(cost, mana_produced)`; `get_activated_abilities`→`ActivatedAbility(cost, effect)`; `cast_spell_free(game, player, card, from_zone)`; `copy_spell(...)`; helper actions in game.py (draw_card, discard, create_token, deal_damage, exile, add_counter, sacrifice).\n   - Typed events in events.py; `move_to_zone` central transition with replacement redirection (`destination` str + `prevented` flag).\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - `/workspace/AGENTS.md`, `/workspace/PROJECT_MAP.md` — workspace rules. Additive-only engine edits; don't touch engine_tests/ or FDN tests.py; FDN cards with tests = fdn_13, fdn_142, fdn_205, fdn_215, fdn_244.\n   - SOS card specs (all read): \n     - sos_1 The Dawning Archaic {10} 7/7 Avatar: costs {1} less per I/S in graveyard; Reach; attacks-trigger → may cast target I/S from graveyard free, if it would go to graveyard exile instead. (complex)\n     - sos_4 Together as One {6} Sorcery: Converge — target player draws X, deals X dmg to any target, you gain X life; X = colors of mana spent. (complex)\n     - sos_13 Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares: ETB target player makes 1/1 W/B Inkling flier; then if opponent controls more creatures, becomes \"prepared\" (Prepared mechanic = cast copy of its spell). (complex)\n     - sos_57 Mana Sculpt {1}{U}{U} Instant: counter target spell; if you control a Wizard, add {C} equal to mana spent to cast that spell at beginning of next main phase. (medium)\n     - sos_97 Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer 