s/sos_245/card_impl.py** — DONE. WitherbloomTheBalancer(Creature) {6}{B}{G} 5/5 Legendary {Elder,Dragon} FLYING|DEATHTOUCH. `cost_reduction` = `_creatures_controlled(game, controller)`. `external_cost_reduction(game, card, controller)`: 0 unless controller is self.controller AND `card.card_types & {INSTANT, SORCERY}`, else creature count. Module helper `_creatures_controlled` counts CREATUREs on battlefield.\n   - **/workspace/cards/sos/sos_245/tests.py** — DONE (9 tests): properties + TestWitherbloomAffinitySelf (cast with reduced mana via set_board_state mana, succeeds/fails) + TestWitherbloomExternalAffinity (I/S Sorcery reduced; creature spell unaffected by external).\n   - **/workspace/cards/sos/sos_4/card_impl.py** — DONE. TogetherAsOne(Sorcery) {6}. `self.colors_spent: int = 0` default. get_targets returns 2 TargetRequirements (player; any target). on_resolve: X from colors_spent (list or int), then draw X for chosen[0], deal X to chosen[1], controller.life += X. X<=0 no-ops.\n   - **/workspace/cards/sos/sos_4/tests.py** — DONE (6 tests): properties + converge through real cast (3 colors via W/U/B mana → lib down 3, p2.life 17, p1.life 23; 0 colors → all no-op; damage to creature target). Helper `_fill_library`.\n   - **/workspace/cards/sos/sos_226/card_impl.py** — DONE. SilverquillTheDisputant(Creature) {2}{W}{B} 4/4 Legendary FLYING|VIGILANCE. register_triggers registers SpellCastTriggeredEvent (source=self, controller). Condition: event.controller is dragon.controller, card is not dragon, card_types & {INSTANT,SORCERY}; **stashes `dragon._casualty_spell = event.spell`** and returns True. Effect reads `dragon._casualty_spell`, finds eligible creatures (CREATURE, power>=1), choose_yes_no, choose_card, sacrifice, `game.stack.push(copy_spell(game, spell, ctrl, new_targets=list(spell.targets)))`.\n   - **/workspace/cards/sos/sos_226/tests.py** — DONE (8 tests): local `_Bolt(Sorcery)` (2 dmg to target player), `_enter` helper using move_to_zone, casualty copies (4 dmg, sac to graveyard), decline (2 dmg, sac stays), creature spell no casualty.\n   - **/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py** — DONE. ManaSculpt(Instant) {1}{U}{U}. Helpers `_get_chosen_target`, `_counter_spell` (copied from fdn_48), `_controls_wizard` (\"Wizard\" in subtypes). can_cast/get_targets iterate game.stack.objects() skipping self. on_resolve: capture `spent = int(getattr(target.source, \"mana_spent\", 0) or 0)` BEFORE counter; _counter_spell; if controls Wizard and spent>0, register one-shot BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent trigger (source=marker object) condition `event.player is controller`, effect adds ManaType.COLORLESS×spent + unregisters marker.\n   - **/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/tests.py** — DONE (8 tests): local `_BigSpell(Instant)` {2}{R}, helpers `_wizard`, `_cast_target`(engine cast, leaves on stack), `_cast_response`(appendleft target + engine cast). Counter test + delayed-mana tests driving BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent through trigger_manager.fire_event + _resolve_top_of_stack (wizard adds 3 {C}; one-shot; only controller's main phase; no wizard → nothing).\n   - **/workspace/cards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py** — STUB (TheDawningArchaic, pass). NOT YET implemented.\n   - **/workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_167/card_impl.py** — REFERENCE: cost_reduction counts I/S in controller graveyard:\n     ```python\n     def cost_reduction(self, game):\n         controller = self.controller\n         if controller is None: return 0\n         count = 0\n         for card in controller.zones[Zone.GRAVEYARD].get_all():\n             ct = getattr(card, \"card_types\", set())\n             if CardType.INSTANT in ct or CardType.SORCERY in ct: count += 1\n         return count\n     ```\n   - **/workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_48/card_impl.py** — REFERENCE: _get_chosen_target, _counter_spell (pops game.stack._items by identity, moves card to graveyard), can_cast/get_targets over game.stack.objects().\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **sos_4 converge tests (test_three_c