ess=4, damage_marked=0, summoning_sick=...`, since combat eligibility keys\n  off `hasattr(c, \"base_power\")`). Register a `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` trigger (needs gap\n  \"spell-cast triggers fire\") that, while animated and `event.controller is self.controller`\n  and `event.card` is I/S, adds an end-of-turn `ContinuousEffect` (Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS /\n  SubLayer.MODIFY_PT) granting +1/+0.\n- **Edge cases:** `{5}` is idempotent if already a creature (guard on CREATURE in\n  card_types). The +1/+0 must be until end of turn (use `DURATION_END_OF_TURN`). Animating\n  doesn't remove LAND, and lands have summoning sickness for *attacking* but tapping for\n  mana is unaffected (the {T} mana abilities still work while animated). The\n  spell-cast +1/+0 trigger should only do anything while the land is currently a creature.\n\n---","numLines":40,"startLine":250,"totalLines":336}}}
