{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01X1Rm52t9W24AvyGv9qnWto","type":"tool_result","content":"164\t### sos_13 — Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares `{1}{W}{W} // {W}` (complex)\n165\t- **Clauses:** Front: Creature — Cat Cleric, 3/3 white. ETB: target player creates a 1/1\n166\t  W/B Inkling token with flying; then if an opponent controls more creatures than you,\n167\t  this creature becomes *prepared*. While prepared, you may cast a copy of its spell\n168\t  (Swords to Plowshares: exile target creature, its controller gains life = its power);\n169\t  casting the copy unprepares it.\n170\t- **FDN analogue:** ETB token creation like `create_token`; activated-ability gating like\n171\t  `cards/fdn/fdn_91` (Kellan) state-flag pattern; targeting like fdn_48.\n172\t- **Seams:** `Creature` front class (the canonical class in this file). Set `self.is_prepared\n173\t  = False` in `__init__`. `register_triggers`: ETB trigger (`EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent`,\n174\t  condition `event.permanent is self`). Effect: choose target player, `create_token` a 1/1\n175\t  flier (`Creature(name=\"Inkling\", base_power=1, base_toughness=1, keywords=Keyword.FLYING)`,\n176\t  colors W/B noted in rules_text); then count creatures: if `opp_creatures > my_creatures`,\n177\t  `self.is_prepared = True`. `get_activated_abilities`: one ability available only when\n178\t  `self.is_prepared` (cost returns False otherwise) — sorcery-speed copy-of-spell:\n179\t  put a Swords effect on the stack (choose target creature; `exile(game, creature)`; that\n180\t  creature's controller `.life += power`), then set `self.is_prepared = False`.\n181\t- **Edge cases:** \"more creatures than you\" strictly greater; the token counts toward\n182\t  *your* count only after it's created (it enters under the *target player*'s control —\n183\t  if you targeted yourself it raises your count). Casting the copy when not prepared is\n184\t  illegal (cost guard). Keep entire DFC behavior card-local; only ETB + targeting + token\n185\t  + exile engine helpers are reused.\n186\t\n187\t### sos_120 — Improvisation Capstone `{5}{R}{R}` Sorcery — Lesson (complex)\n188\t- **Clauses:** Exile from top of library until total MV ≥ 4; you may cast any number of\n189\t  them for free. Paradigm: exile this spell; after you first resolve a spell with this\n190\t  name, you may cast a copy of it from exile for free at the beginning of each of your\n191\t  first main phases.\n192\t- **FDN analogue:** `cast_spell_free` for the free casts; main-phase delayed trigger\n193\t  (new event); MV via `ManaCost.cmc`.\n194\t- **Seams:** `Sorcery`. `on_resolve`: from `self.controller` library top, move cards to\n195\t  exile (`move_to_zone(... Zone.LIBRARY, Zone.EXILE)`) accumulating `cmc` until total ≥ 4;\n196\t  for each exiled card that is castable, offer `choose_yes_no` then\n197\t  `cast_spell_free(game, controller, c, Zone.EXILE)`. Paradigm: after resolving, exile\n198\t  *this* card (the engine would send a sorcery to graveyard — override by moving self to\n199\t  exile in `on_resolve`/via replacement) and register a repeating\n200\t  `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` trigger (needs gap \"main-phase event\"), condition\n201\t  `event.player is controller and event.is_precombat`, effect: offer to cast a copy of\n202\t  this card from exile for free.\n203\t- **Edge cases:** library runs out before reaching MV 4 → stop. Lands among exiled cards\n204\t  can't be \"cast\" (skip — only cast spells). Paradigm copy is a *copy* (don't move the\n205\t  exiled original; create a token-copy or re-castable copy). \"First resolve\" → register the\n206\t  Paradigm trigger only once. This is the hardest part; Paradigm may be implemented after\n207\t  the base spell works.\n208\t\n209\t### sos_201 — Lorehold, the Historian `{3}{R}{W}` 5/5 Elder Dragon (expert)\n210\t- **Clauses:** Flying, haste. \"Each instant and sorcery card in your hand has miracle {2}.\"\n211\t  \"At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, you may discard a card; if you do, draw a\n212\t  card.\"\n213\t- **FDN analogue:** opponent-upkeep loot — `DrawsCardTriggeredEvent`/upkeep trigger\n214\t  patterns (fdn_28 surveil shows draw-trigger + choose plumbing); miracle uses the new\n215\t  `cast_with_alternative_cost`.\n216\t- **Seams:** `keywords=Keyword.FLYING|Keyword.HASTE`. `register_triggers`: (a)\n217\t  `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent` trigger (needs gap \"upkeep player field\"); condition\n218\t  `event.player is not self.controller`; effect: `choose_yes_no` → if yes pick a card to\n219\t  discard (`choose_card`), `discard`, then `draw_card`. (b) Miracle: register a\n220\t  `DrawsCardTriggeredEvent` trigger; condition: `event.player is self.controller`, the\n221\t  drawn `event.card` is I/S and owned by controller, and it is the first card drawn this\n222\t  turn (`event.player.cards_drawn_this_turn == 1` — engine increments before firing).\n223\t  Effect: `choose_yes_no(\"Cast for miracle {2}?\")`; if yes,"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ccba73e9-54b6-4808-89ce-87e442914ff8","uuid":"e6e83ea6-1e55-42eb-9eb4-359e3775dd8d","timestamp":"2026-06-04T08:07:33.266Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/PLAN.md","content":"### sos_13 — Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares `{1}{W}{W} // {W}` (complex)\n- **Clauses:** Front: Creature — Cat Cleric, 3/3 white. ETB: target player creates a 1/1\n  W/B Inkling token with flying; then if an opponent controls more creatures than you,\n  this creature becomes *prepared*. While prepared, you may cast a copy of its spell\n  (Swords to Plowshares: exile target creature, its controller gains life = its power);\n  casting the copy unprepares it.\n- **FDN analogue:** ETB token creation like `create_token`; activated-ability gating like\n  `cards/fdn/fdn_91` (Kellan) state-flag pattern; targeting like fdn_48.\n- **Seams:** `Creature` front class (the canonical class in this file). Set `self.is_prepared\n  = False` in `__init__`. `register_triggers`: ETB trigger (`EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent`,\n  condition `event.permanent is self`). Effect: choose target player, `create_token` a 1/1\n  flier (`Creature(name=\"Inkling\", base_power=1, base_toughness=1, keywords=Keyword.FLYING)`,\n  colors W/B noted in rules_text); then count creatures: if `opp_creatures > my_creatures`,\n  `self.is_prepared = True`. `get_activated_abilities`: one ability available only when\n  `self.is_prepared` (cost returns False otherwise) — sorcery-speed copy-of-spell:\n  put a Swords effect on the stack (choose target creature; `exile(game, creature)`; that\n  creature's controller `.life += power`), then set `self.is_prepared = False`.\n- **Edge cases:** \"more creatures than you\" strictly greater; the token counts toward\n  *your* count only after it's created (it enters under the *target player*'s control —\n  if you targeted yourself it raises your count). Casting the copy when not prepared is\n  illegal (cost guard). Keep entire DFC behavior card-local; only ETB + targeting + token\n  + exile engine helpers are reused.\n\n### sos_120 — Improvisation Capstone `{5}{R}{R}` Sorcery — Lesson (complex)\n- **Clauses:** Exile from top of library until total MV ≥ 4; you may cast any number of\n  them for free. Paradigm: exile this spell; after you first resolve a spell with this\n  name, you may cast a copy of it from exile for free at the beginning of each of your\n  first main phases.\n- **FDN analogue:** `cast_spell_free` for the free casts; main-phase delayed trigger\n  (new event); MV via `ManaCost.cmc`.\n- **Seams:** `Sorcery`. `on_resolve`: from `self.controller` library top, move cards to\n  exile (`move_to_zone(... Zone.LIBRARY, Zone.EXILE)`) accumulating `cmc` until total ≥ 4;\n  for each exiled card that is castable, offer `choose_yes_no` then\n  `cast_spell_free(game, controller, c, Zone.EXILE)`. Paradigm: after resolving, exile\n  *this* card (the engine would send a sorcery to graveyard — override by moving self to\n  exile in `on_resolve`/via replacement) and register a repeating\n  `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` trigger (needs gap \"main-phase event\"), condition\n  `event.player is controller and event.is_precombat`, effect: offer to cast a copy of\n  this card from exile for free.\n- **Edge cases:** library runs out before reaching MV 4 → stop. Lands among exiled cards\n  can't be \"cast\" (skip — only cast spells). Paradigm copy is a *copy* (don't move the\n  exiled original; create a token-copy or re-castable copy). \"First resolve\" → register the\n  Paradigm trigger only once. This is the hardest part; Paradigm may be implemented after\n  the base spell works.\n\n### sos_201 — Lorehold, the Historian `{3}{R}{W}` 5/5 Elder Dragon (expert)\n- **Clauses:** Flying, haste. \"Each instant and sorcery card in your hand has miracle {2}.\"\n  \"At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, you may discard a card; if you do, draw a\n  card.\"\n- **FDN analogue:** opponent-upkeep loot — `DrawsCardTriggeredEvent`/upkeep trigger\n  patterns (fdn_28 surveil shows draw-trigger + choose plumbing); miracle uses the new\n  `cast_with_alternative_cost`.\n- **Seams:** `keywords=Keyword.FLYING|Keyword.HASTE`. `register_triggers`: (a)\n  `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent` trigger (needs gap \"upkeep player field\"); condition\n  `event.player is not self.controller`; effect: `choose_yes_no` → if yes pick a card to\n  discard (`choose_card`), `discard`, then `draw_card`. (b) Miracle: register a\n  `DrawsCardTriggeredEvent` trigger; condition: `event.player is self.controller`, the\n  drawn `event.card` is I/S and owned by controller, and it is the first card drawn this\n  turn (`event.player.cards_drawn_this_turn == 1` — engine increments before firing).\n  Effect: `choose_yes_no(\"Cast for miracle {2}?\")`; if yes,","numLines":60,"startLine":164,"totalLines":336}}}
