{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01CfZ1xp38eaZHkN34318vn3","type":"tool_result","content":"364\t    def _on_resolve(g: GameState) -> None:\n365\t        _resolve_spell(g, card, player, stack_obj)\n366\t\n367\t    stack_obj.on_resolve = _on_resolve\n368\t    game.stack.push(stack_obj)\n369\t\n370\t    from engine.events import SpellCastTriggeredEvent\n371\t    game.trigger_manager.fire_event(\n372\t        game,\n373\t        SpellCastTriggeredEvent(\n374\t            spell=stack_obj, player=player, card=card, controller=player\n375\t        ),\n376\t    )\n377\t\n378\t\n379\t# ------------------------------------------------------------------\n380\t# Cast spell without paying mana cost (free-cast from any zone)\n381\t# ------------------------------------------------------------------\n382\t\n383\t\n384\tdef cast_spell_free(\n385\t    game: GameState,\n386\t    player: Player,\n387\t    card: CardImpl,\n388\t    from_zone: Zone,\n389\t) -> None:\n390\t    \"\"\"Cast *card* without paying its mana cost, using the stack.\n391\t\n392\t    This is used by effects that allow casting from zones other than hand\n393\t    (e.g. exile) without paying mana costs — such as Etali, Primal Storm\n394\t    or cascade.\n395\t\n396\t    Pipeline\n397\t    --------\n398\t    1. **can_cast** — ask the card whether it can legally be cast (same\n399\t       legality as :func:`cast_spell`, minus mana/timing constraints).\n400\t    2. Move *card* from *from_zone* to the stack zone.\n401\t    3. Choose targets (if applicable) with validation and protection check.\n402\t    4. Call ``on_cast`` hook.\n403\t    5. Push a :class:`StackObject` whose ``on_resolve`` callback handles\n404\t       resolution normally (permanents → battlefield, non-permanents →\n405\t       graveyard).\n406\t\n407\t    No timing check or mana payment is performed.  The spell goes on the\n408\t    stack and can be responded to normally (e.g. countered).\n409\t\n410\t    If targeting or other post-move checks fail, the card is rolled back\n411\t    to its source zone.\n412\t\n413\t    Parameters:\n414\t        game: The current game state.\n415\t        player: The player casting the spell.\n416\t        card: The card to cast.\n417\t        from_zone: The zone the card is currently in.\n418\t\n419\t    Raises:\n420\t        CastingError: If the card cannot be found in *from_zone* or\n421\t            legality checks fail.\n422\t    \"\"\"\n423\t    from engine.zones import move_to_zone"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ccba73e9-54b6-4808-89ce-87e442914ff8","uuid":"8a71022e-2a80-42d5-a11d-8e2f77b87f31","timestamp":"2026-06-04T08:23:37.177Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/engine/casting.py","content":"    def _on_resolve(g: GameState) -> None:\n        _resolve_spell(g, card, player, stack_obj)\n\n    stack_obj.on_resolve = _on_resolve\n    game.stack.push(stack_obj)\n\n    from engine.events import SpellCastTriggeredEvent\n    game.trigger_manager.fire_event(\n        game,\n        SpellCastTriggeredEvent(\n            spell=stack_obj, player=player, card=card, controller=player\n        ),\n    )\n\n\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------\n# Cast spell without paying mana cost (free-cast from any zone)\n# ------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n\ndef cast_spell_free(\n    game: GameState,\n    player: Player,\n    card: CardImpl,\n    from_zone: Zone,\n) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Cast *card* without paying its mana cost, using the stack.\n\n    This is used by effects that allow casting from zones other than hand\n    (e.g. exile) without paying mana costs — such as Etali, Primal Storm\n    or cascade.\n\n    Pipeline\n    --------\n    1. **can_cast** — ask the card whether it can legally be cast (same\n       legality as :func:`cast_spell`, minus mana/timing constraints).\n    2. Move *card* from *from_zone* to the stack zone.\n    3. Choose targets (if applicable) with validation and protection check.\n    4. Call ``on_cast`` hook.\n    5. Push a :class:`StackObject` whose ``on_resolve`` callback handles\n       resolution normally (permanents → battlefield, non-permanents →\n       graveyard).\n\n    No timing check or mana payment is performed.  The spell goes on the\n    stack and can be responded to normally (e.g. countered).\n\n    If targeting or other post-move checks fail, the card is rolled back\n    to its source zone.\n\n    Parameters:\n        game: The current game state.\n        player: The player casting the spell.\n        card: The card to cast.\n        from_zone: The zone the card is currently in.\n\n    Raises:\n        CastingError: If the card cannot be found in *from_zone* or\n            legality checks fail.\n    \"\"\"\n    from engine.zones import move_to_zone","numLines":60,"startLine":364,"totalLines":648}}}
