{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016czRCY77EoorxY455YQJT9","type":"tool_result","content":"325\t\n326\t**Group 3 — Multi-clause permanents.**\n327\t- **sos_257 Great Hall** (mana abilities + animate + spell-cast +1/+0 trigger).\n328\t- **sos_13 Emeritus of Truce** (ETB token + prepared activated copy-spell).\n329\t\n330\t**Group 4 — Expert / multi-system (hardest, last).**\n331\tRationale: each combines several seams and has the most edge cases.\n332\t- **sos_97 Ral Zarek** (4 loyalty abilities incl. surveil, reanimation w/ MV filter, and\n333\t  the skip-turns ultimate).\n334\t- **sos_201 Lorehold** (opponent-upkeep loot via upkeep-player field + miracle via\n335\t  `cast_with_alternative_cost` on the draw trigger).\n336\t- **sos_120 Improvisation Capstone** (exile-until-MV free casts + Paradigm repeating\n337\t  main-phase copy) — most novel control flow; finish last.\n338\t\n339\tFor each card: write `cards/sos/sos_<N>/tests.py` covering the golden path + the listed\n340\tedge cases, and run `pytest cards/sos/sos_<N>` plus the full `pytest` before moving on.\n341\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ccba73e9-54b6-4808-89ce-87e442914ff8","uuid":"949f3bad-1ade-437e-bf79-82e68d86bbb4","timestamp":"2026-06-04T08:40:07.538Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/PLAN.md","content":"\n**Group 3 — Multi-clause permanents.**\n- **sos_257 Great Hall** (mana abilities + animate + spell-cast +1/+0 trigger).\n- **sos_13 Emeritus of Truce** (ETB token + prepared activated copy-spell).\n\n**Group 4 — Expert / multi-system (hardest, last).**\nRationale: each combines several seams and has the most edge cases.\n- **sos_97 Ral Zarek** (4 loyalty abilities incl. surveil, reanimation w/ MV filter, and\n  the skip-turns ultimate).\n- **sos_201 Lorehold** (opponent-upkeep loot via upkeep-player field + miracle via\n  `cast_with_alternative_cost` on the draw trigger).\n- **sos_120 Improvisation Capstone** (exile-until-MV free casts + Paradigm repeating\n  main-phase copy) — most novel control flow; finish last.\n\nFor each card: write `cards/sos/sos_<N>/tests.py` covering the golden path + the listed\nedge cases, and run `pytest cards/sos/sos_<N>` plus the full `pytest` before moving on.\n","numLines":17,"startLine":325,"totalLines":341}}}
