{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AaggaAAv98Ckm5Xjhe7dy4","type":"tool_result","content":"192\t### sos_120 — Improvisation Capstone `{5}{R}{R}` Sorcery — Lesson (complex)\n193\t- **Clauses:** Exile from top of library until total MV ≥ 4; you may cast any number of\n194\t  them for free. Paradigm: exile this spell; after you first resolve a spell with this\n195\t  name, you may cast a copy of it from exile for free at the beginning of each of your\n196\t  first main phases.\n197\t- **FDN analogue:** `cast_spell_free` for the free casts; main-phase delayed trigger\n198\t  (new event); MV via `ManaCost.cmc`.\n199\t- **Seams:** `Sorcery`. `on_resolve`: from `self.controller` library top, move cards to\n200\t  exile (`move_to_zone(... Zone.LIBRARY, Zone.EXILE)`) accumulating `cmc` until total ≥ 4;\n201\t  for each exiled card that is castable, offer `choose_yes_no` then\n202\t  `cast_spell_free(game, controller, c, Zone.EXILE)`. Paradigm: after resolving, exile\n203\t  *this* card (the engine would send a sorcery to graveyard — override by moving self to\n204\t  exile in `on_resolve`/via replacement) and register a repeating\n205\t  `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` trigger (needs gap \"main-phase event\"), condition\n206\t  `event.player is controller and event.is_precombat`, effect: offer to cast a copy of\n207\t  this card from exile for free.\n208\t- **Edge cases:** library runs out before reaching MV 4 → stop. Lands among exiled cards\n209\t  can't be \"cast\" (skip — only cast spells). Paradigm copy is a *copy* (don't move the\n210\t  exiled original; create a token-copy or re-castable copy). \"First resolve\" → register the\n211\t  Paradigm trigger only once. This is the hardest part; Paradigm may be implemented after\n212\t  the base spell works.\n213\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ccba73e9-54b6-4808-89ce-87e442914ff8","uuid":"c96ac11d-905d-4c98-89ce-d8d4710d24bc","timestamp":"2026-06-04T08:40:10.351Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/PLAN.md","content":"### sos_120 — Improvisation Capstone `{5}{R}{R}` Sorcery — Lesson (complex)\n- **Clauses:** Exile from top of library until total MV ≥ 4; you may cast any number of\n  them for free. Paradigm: exile this spell; after you first resolve a spell with this\n  name, you may cast a copy of it from exile for free at the beginning of each of your\n  first main phases.\n- **FDN analogue:** `cast_spell_free` for the free casts; main-phase delayed trigger\n  (new event); MV via `ManaCost.cmc`.\n- **Seams:** `Sorcery`. `on_resolve`: from `self.controller` library top, move cards to\n  exile (`move_to_zone(... Zone.LIBRARY, Zone.EXILE)`) accumulating `cmc` until total ≥ 4;\n  for each exiled card that is castable, offer `choose_yes_no` then\n  `cast_spell_free(game, controller, c, Zone.EXILE)`. Paradigm: after resolving, exile\n  *this* card (the engine would send a sorcery to graveyard — override by moving self to\n  exile in `on_resolve`/via replacement) and register a repeating\n  `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` trigger (needs gap \"main-phase event\"), condition\n  `event.player is controller and event.is_precombat`, effect: offer to cast a copy of\n  this card from exile for free.\n- **Edge cases:** library runs out before reaching MV 4 → stop. Lands among exiled cards\n  can't be \"cast\" (skip — only cast spells). Paradigm copy is a *copy* (don't move the\n  exiled original; create a token-copy or re-castable copy). \"First resolve\" → register the\n  Paradigm trigger only once. This is the hardest part; Paradigm may be implemented after\n  the base spell works.\n","numLines":22,"startLine":192,"totalLines":341}}}
